013900* --- 1000-INITIALISE: START OF RUN
014000 1000-INITIALISE.
014100     MOVE FUNCTION CURRENT-DATE(1:8) TO WS-RUN-TS
014200     STRING WS-RUN-TS(1:4) '-' WS-RUN-TS(5:2) '-' WS-RUN-TS(7:2)
014300        DELIMITED BY SIZE INTO WS-RUN-DATE
014400     MOVE 'CLRBATCH' TO WS-USER-ID
