030500     MOVE 'CLR.T_ASSESSOR_ASSIGNMENT ROWS READ' TO RT-LABEL
030600     MOVE WS-ASSESSOR-ASSIGNMENT-READ TO RT-COUNT
030700     WRITE REPORT-RECORD FROM WS-RPT-TOTAL
030800     CLOSE REPORT-FILE
030900     CLOSE EXTRACT-FILE
031000     IF WS-REJECT-CNT > ZERO
031100        MOVE 4 TO RETURN-CODE
031200     END-IF
031300     .
