033600     WRITE REPORT-RECORD FROM WS-RPT-DETAIL
033700     MOVE '  CLAIM_ID' TO RD-LABEL
033800     MOVE ASG-CLAIM-ID TO RD-VALUE
033900     WRITE REPORT-RECORD FROM WS-RPT-DETAIL
034000     MOVE '  ASSESSOR_ID' TO RD-LABEL
