034200     WRITE REPORT-RECORD FROM WS-RPT-DETAIL
034300     MOVE '  VENDOR_CD' TO RD-LABEL
034400     MOVE ASG-VENDOR-CD TO RD-VALUE
034500     WRITE REPORT-RECORD FROM WS-RPT-DETAIL
034600     MOVE '  APPOINTED_TS' TO RD-LABEL
